   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Household cons behavior</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Hush konsum studie Nov</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att utf&#xF6;ra en hush&#xE5;llsstudie bland 100 hush&#xE5;ll i Novgorods l&#xE4;n f&#xF6;r att fastst&#xE4;lla konsumentm&#xF6;nster och -beteende i syfte att formulera en ny l&#xE4;roplan i &#xE4;mnet hush&#xE5;llsekonomi p&#xE5; l&#xE4;rarutbildning i &#xE4;mnet teknologi p&#xE5; Novgorod State University.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project intends to make a household survey in order to define consumer household behavior in 100 households in Novgorod. The results will form the basis for the development of new curricula in Home Economics for technology teachers at Novgorod State Univ.</narrative>
  </description>
